{"evt":"summary_set","id":"4b12fe1f-4bef-4c82-908d-0f07f56f3638/12","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","summary":"Implemented per-drain backoff + configurable cadence + jitter for headless drains. Changes in lib/headless-drain.js: (1) _governor.drains sub-object holds per-drain { consecutiveThrottles, backoffUntil, lastRunAt }; (2) recordDrainOutcome now accepts drainKey + isLlmBacked params — updates per-drain state alongside global, label passes isLlmBacked=false to avoid polluting LLM backoff; (3) drainIntervalConfig() reads ORCH_DRAIN_JUDGE_INTERVAL_MS / _LEARNER_ / _LABEL_ env vars (default 2 min each); (4) applyJitter() adds ±10% random noise to cadence checks; (5) shouldRunDrain(drainKey, type, nowMs) checks per-drain backoff + cadence before each drain type runs inside runDueDrains; (6) _runOneJudge sets lastRunAt before spawning. 20 new tests added; all 82 tests pass. Branch: orch/attempt/4b12fe1f-4bef-4c82-908d-0f07f56f3638-12, commit 9fc84fe.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-18T15:10:08.069Z"}
